538 0 obj
<<
/A 3138 0 R
/Alt (A four panel diagram compares microbiome data across MET and ONT platforms. Panel A shows two violin plots with overlaid data points for Shannon index values. The MET plot is slightly wider and taller than the ONT plot, indicating a broader distribution and slightly higher diversity. Panel B is a dense scatter plot of pairwise Aitchison distances between samples, with MET on the vertical axis and ONT on the horizontal axis. A solid regression line shows a positive correlation, with Spearman rho equals 0.48 and P equals 1e minus 04. Panel C presents a Procrustes analysis ordination plot with Procrustes axis 1 and Procrustes axis 2. Data points for ONT and MET are overlaid, with lines connecting matched samples. The points are clustered centrally, with some outliers. Procrustes r equals 0.597 and P equals 1e minus 04. Panel D is a scatter plot of log10 mean relative abundance for species, with MET on the vertical axis and ONT on the horizontal axis. A dashed diagonal line represents perfect correlation. Data points are clustered along this line, showing a strong positive correlation with Spearman rho equals 0.75 and P less than 1 times 10 to the power of minus 4.)
/ID (KKMYSJ+)
/K 0
/P 512 0 R
/Pg 18 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
