/A 3156 0 R
/Alt (A three panel scientific figure presents data on microbiota based risk scores and caries burden. Panel A contains eight violin plots with embedded box plots, arranged in two rows of four. The vertical axis is labelled Risk score, ranging from 0.0 to 10.0. The plots are titled MODS MET detection, MODS ONT detection, STAGE detection, SMAC detection, MODS MET CLR abundance, MODS ONT CLR abundance, STAGE CLR abundance, and SMAC CLR abundance. The detection plots show varying distributions, with STAGE detection concentrated near 0.0, while MODS MET detection has a wider spread. The CLR abundance plots show broader distributions, with MODS MET CLR abundance ranging from approximately minus 40 to 20. Panel B is a forest plot illustrating effect sizes for four categories: MODS MET, MODS ONT, STAGE, and SMAC. The horizontal axis is labelled Effect size beta for DMFS, ranging from 0.0 to 10.0. Each category has two data points with error bars and p values. For MODS MET, points are at approximately 4.0 p equals 6.50e minus 19 and 7.5 p equals 3.37e minus 17. For MODS ONT, points are at approximately 4.2 p equals 9.36e minus 14 and 6.0 p equals 1.41e minus 10. For STAGE, points are at approximately 4.8 p equals 8.99e minus 43 and 1.8 p equals 5.37e minus 16. For SMAC, points are near 0.0 with p values 1.52e minus 05 and 3.22e minus 03. Panel C contains two line graphs with error bars.)
/ID (DDUWJG+)
/K 14
/P 554 0 R
/Pg 20 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
